  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b968da625e3936f9364a60f4ec3bdc8f1d4b1d1db9850270d1f3b4f0822dfd51.png] \n\nLet's check each option,\n\n**1) ÷ × + -**\n\n→ **5 ÷ 25** × 5 + 11 - 9 = 23\n\n→ **1/5 ×**** 5** + 11 - 9 = 23\n\n→ **1 +**** 11** - 9 = 23\n\n→ 12 - 9 = 23\n\n→ 3 ≠ 23\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**2) × ÷ - +**\n\n→ 5 × **25 ÷ 5** - 11 + 9 = 23\n\n→ **5 × 5** - 11 + 9 = 23\n\n→ **25** - 11 **+**** 9** = 23\n\n→ 34 - 11 = 23\n\n→ 23 = 23\n\n→ **LHS = RHS **→ **Satisfies the equation.**\n\n**3) × ÷ + -**\n\n→ 5 × **25 ÷ 5** + 11 - 9 = 23\n\n→ **5 × 5** + 11 - 9 = 23\n\n→ **25 +**** 11** - 9 = 23\n\n→ 36 - 9 = 23\n\n→ 27 ≠ 23\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS.\n\n**4) + - × ÷**\n\n→ 5 + 25 - 5 × **11 ÷ 9** = 23\n\n→ 5 + 25 - **5 ****× 11/9** = 23\n\n→ **5 +**** 25** - 55/9 = 23\n\n→ 30 - 55/9 = 23\n\n→ 215/9 ≠ 23\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nHere, we can see that only Option 2 satisfies the equation.\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"× ÷ - +\"**.",
